# Sort the AI Approaches

In Intelligence Card Sort, students group real behaviors, human, animal, and machine, based on what kind of intelligence each one shows. Before you facilitate that discussion, try a version of the sort yourself below and notice how quickly "AI" stops feeling like one single thing.

<div style="width:100%; border-radius:10px; overflow:hidden; margin:20px 0;">
  <iframe
    src="https://amandadennard-dotcom.github.io/AIFY2/unit-1/ai-approaches-sort.html"
    width="100%"
    height="1150"
    frameborder="0"
    scrolling="no"
    title="Sort AI examples into Rule-Based Logic or Learns from Data"
    style="display:block; border-radius:10px;">
  </iframe>
</div>


